'''Dr. Stone''' is an [[NPC]] located on in the {{Zone|Fossil Research Center}} in the {{Zone|Dwarven Base Camp}} who collects [[Fossils]] and unlocks several pets in {{Zone|The Forge}}.

== Usage ==
'''Dr. Stone''' teaches the player about [[Chisel]]s and [[Fossils]]. Donating unique [[Fossils]] to them grants {{Green|25,000}} {{Skl|Mining}} XP, {{Glacite Powder|25,000}}, {{Item|Fossil Essence|amount=100}}, {{HotM EXP|5,000}}{{ConfirmationNeeded}}, and {{SBXP|10}}, additionally unlocking a recipe in the [[Forge]]. Donating all {{Green|8}} [[Fossils]] to them grants an additional {{Glacite Powder|50,000}} and {{HotM EXP|10,000}}{{ConfirmationNeeded}}.

